  "body": "The algorithm segment for rdf:RDF has a buffer over-read at step 3.\r\n\r\nStep 2.\r\n\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/\" (24 chars) compare with length 24, followed by\r\n\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\" (43 chars) compare with length 43\r\n\r\nStep 3.\r\n\"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\" (43 chars) compare with **length 24**, followed by\r\n\"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/\" (24 chars) compare with **length 43**\r\n\r\nI'm guessing the intent is to find \"http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#\"  and \"http://purl.org/rss/1.0/\" in any order, so probably just a copy and paste error (but somebody should confirm the intent).\r\n\r\n\r\n",
